>>4) I know blessed magic lamps always give wishes but if a potion has a djinni
>>   in it can you be sure of getting a wish?
>
>	If the potion has a djinn in it, you'll get a wish.  The problem is
>determining whether or not the potion has a djinn in it.

A smoky potion has a 1 in 13 chance of containing a djinni.  The blessed/
cursed status of the potion works just like magic lamps.
  Blessed potion/magic lamp: the djinni will grant you a wish
  Uncursed potion/magic lamp: 1 in five chance of the djinni:
                               - granting you a wish
                               - being tame
                               - being peaceful
                               - being annoyed and disappearing
                               - being hostile
  Cursed potion/magic lamp: the djinni will be hostile

